  "description": "“Just abandon me, CEO.” \n\nBack then, I should’ve left it as a one-sided crush. No—Kwon Taejoo… maybe things would’ve been better if I’d never held you in my heart, or even laid eyes on you. \n\n“You wanted this.” \n\nThe lingering feelings I couldn’t let go of ended up cutting me deeply. \n\n“I thought you wanted me to pretend not to know. Was I wrong?” \n\nAs though surrendering at the end of a desperate longing, the confession I let slip was trampled like a rag beneath his cruel scoff.\n\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12711023)   \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12711093)",
